                                "sense_id": "a40009ff-c40f-365b-8535-2b9b3a478aa1",
                                "text": "And yet at first it seemed hard to believe that so innocent a cloudling could be the progenitor of mist dense enough to blot out even a section of the enormous landscape."
                            },
